  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_puzzle",
      "name": {
        "en": "Puzzle's Badge",
        "zh": "谜图证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_puzzle",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Puzzle has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude in repeated battlefield penetration and establishing advantageous situations for allies in the field.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Vanguard Operator during field operations to exercise Agent responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员谜图擅长反复切入战场并为我方建立优势\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为先锋干员，行使情报官职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_puzzle",
      "name": {
        "en": "Top Priority",
        "zh": "首要任务",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_puzzle",
      "description": {
        "en": "'Mission Objective: Track and investigate the individual named Harmonie.\nMission Details: Track the target in County Trent, then monitor and investigate.\nMission Result: Successful. Confirmed to be a Dublinn intelligence officer. For more details refer to page three of Main Report One.\nMission Objective: Investigate and identify the mysterious key figure.\nMission Details: Investigate the key figure of the County Hillock incident and learn about their background and current situation.\nMission Result: Successful. Individual identified as Loughshinny, a female Draco. For her personal information, relationship with Dublinn, and activity history in Counties Hillock and Trent, refer to page six of Main Report Two.'\nFischer sits at a city council office desk, writing furiously. After accidentally contracting Oripathy, this is the first time he has gotten the chance to sort out what happened during that period.\nHe is more than familiar with the procedure. A mission report is but the final page of intelligence work. He only needs to record a success or failure, and in theory it would be impossible for complications to occur.\n'Mission Objective: Scout the Dublinn troops' movements.'\nHe suddenly stops writing, and the feeling from several hours ago resurfaces, confusion and disorder once more intertwining inside his mind. He seems to hear again those Tarans crying out just before they die, the roars of a high-speed battleship passing through the land, and that poor refugee merchant's house crashing down.\n'Note: During the scouting operation, a Taran refugee was discovered residing in the path of the Dublinn army's landship, and was warned and persuaded to leave the area.'\nHe involuntarily adds the sentence before immediately striking it out with his pen. The refugee might have survived, but his fate no longer matters. A war affecting millions of lives is practically an inevitability.\nChaos and disorder will continue to spread, yet he has no power to do a thing about it with his current identity.\nHe looks at the side of his desk, where fragments of white lie scattered upon it. A puzzle he somehow just can't figure out how to solve today.\nIn silence he tears up the report. If he is unable to solve it the way he used to, he might as well start anew from the first piece. He needs to start from a new perspective, instead of solving this riddle with any of the identities granted to him.\nA sudden knock sounds, and a man suited in gray pushes open the office door.\n'Mr. Fischer, the car called by the Duke is here, waiting for you downstairs.' The man brings an unexpected order.\n'Just a moment. I'll go once I'm done with this last document.' He replies immediately, with a new plan already in mind.\nOutside the window, the sky ushers in a long-absent sun.",
        "zh": "“任务目标：跟踪并调查目标人物阿赫茉妮。\n任务内容：于特伦特郡追踪目标，对其进行监控和调查。\n任务结果：任务成功。已证实其为深池情报人员。调查报告详见主报告一，页三。\n任务目标：调查神秘关键人物的身份。\n任务内容：调查小丘郡事件中的关键人物，查明此人的背景和现状。\n任务结果：任务成功。已证实该关键人物为拉芙希妮，女，德拉克。其个人信息、与深池的关系，以及其在小丘郡与特伦特郡事件中的活动详见主报告二，页六。”\n菲舍尔坐在市政厅办公室的书桌前奋笔疾书。意外感染了矿石病之后，这是他第一次有机会整理这段时间发生的事情。\n他早已熟知这套流程，行动报告对于情报工作来说只是最后的收尾，只需要记录成功或失败，理论上不会有节外生枝的可能。\n“任务目标：侦察深池军队的动向。”\n他忽然停下笔，数小时之前的感知再次涌现，那些混乱和无序又一次在他脑中交织。他似乎又听到了塔拉人死前的呼号、高速军舰驶过大地的轰鸣，还有那个不幸的流民商人的房屋崩塌的声音。\n“备注：执行侦察行动期间注意到深池军队航线上有塔拉流民在活动，对其施以警告并劝离。”\n他不由自主地在报告里加上了一句，但下一秒又用笔将它划掉。那个流民也许能活下来，但这已经微不足道。眼下，牵动千万人生死的战争已不可避免。\n混乱会持续蔓延，失序会迅速扩散，而如今的身份对此无能为力。\n他看向办公桌的旁边，白色的碎片还散落着，他今天有一幅不知为何总是无法完成的拼图。\n他沉默着撕下作废的报告。如果不能继续使用过去的解法，那不如重新从放置第一块碎片开始。他需要给自己一个新的起点，而不是用过去被给予的任何身份去解答这个谜题。\n敲门声忽然响起，一个身穿灰色正装的男子推开了办公室的门。\n“菲舍尔先生，公爵给您安排的车到了，在楼下等您。”男子带来了意料之外的命令。\n“请稍候，我处理完最后这份公文就出发。”他马上回答，心中已经有了新的计划。\n窗外，天空迎来了久违的晴朗。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
